屽氨鐪嬪埌浜嗕竴鏍�涓冭壊鑺辫暰杩樻病缁芥斁銆�", "鈥滆繕鐪熸槸锛佸ぉ鍟婏紒鈥濊枦瀛愮殦鍜屼竾淇熻景灏辩畻涓嶆噦鐐奸噾锛屼篃鏄庣櫧閭ｄ竷鑹茬幉鐝戠殑鐝嶈吹浜嗐�傛浘缁忥紝鍥藉唴鐨勭��涓�鐐奸噾甯堥噸閲戞眰璐�涓冭壊鐜茬彂锛屽嵈鍙�璐�寰椾簡涓夋牚銆傜█鏈夌▼搴﹀彲瑙佷竴鏂戙�傝嫢鏄�浠ュ墠锛屽�掓槸鍙�浠ュ崠鎺夋崲閽憋紝浣嗘槸锛岀幇鍦ㄨ�歌憶鏄庢湀灏辨槸鐐奸噾甯堬紝鑷�鐒朵笉浼氶殢鎰忓崠鎺変簡銆�", "鈥滈偅鏄�鐢ㄦ潵鐐煎埗浠�涔堢殑锛熲�濅竾淇熻景涓ょ溂鏀惧厜鐨勯棶閬擄紝璇寸潃灏辨兂瑕佸幓閲囥��", "锛嶏紞锛嶏紞锛嶏紞棰樺�栬瘽锛嶏紞锛嶏紞锛嶏紞", "杩欎釜鏂囷紝鏈�鏈堝簲璇ヨ繕涓婁笉浜嗘灦銆傝繕鏈夛紝鏈堢エ鐨勯棶棰橈紝鐜板湪鏈堢エ鏄�娑堣垂婊″崄鍏冨氨鏈変竴寮犳湀绁�锛屽綋鏈堟姇鎺夛紝涓嶈兘鐣欏埌涓嬫湀銆備笅鏈堝氨娌′簡鍟娿��"], "_garbled": false, "novel_title": "腹黑狂女:倾城召唤师", "content_zh": "第8章 我差点就走光了！“那行，等考核完我去买点材料。”诸葛明月想了想说道，“材料要去买，简单的工具家里有。我一会再看看还需要点什么。”“哇，诸葛，你什么时候会炼金的？我们怎么不知道？”万俟辰惊讶的问道。“以前无聊的时候看过点。不过，你们怎么可能知道？以前你们又没和我说过话。”诸葛明月鄙视的看了眼万俟辰。万俟辰耷拉下脑袋不说话了，有些沮丧起来。诸葛明月以前在学校中，和她说话的人没几个的，更不要提朋友了。诸葛明月一个朋友都没有的！“行了，胖子，我们现在不在说话么？”诸葛明月看着沮丧的胖子，有些不忍的开口。其实也怪不得万俟辰的，以前的诸葛明月就是那么孤僻的一个人。不过，对于炼金的问题，诸葛明月倒没有说谎，以前的诸葛明月就是无聊的时候，学过点最基础的炼金。所以家里有最简单的工具，最基础的配方她也知道一些。但是炼金确实太鸡肋且浪费时间，后来，诸葛明月便没有再学了。“嗯嗯，诸葛，我们现在还一起去参加初级召唤师考核呢。”万俟辰一听，来了精神，双眼亮晶晶的点头附和道。“嗯。等考核完我们去买点材料。”诸葛明月说完，看了看召唤师协会的大门，大门很气派，而且今天还很热闹。今日来参加初级召唤师考核的人不少，都是昨天在学院成功召唤出魔宠的学员。“我在外面等你们啊。你们一定都要通过考核啊。”薛子皓背着弓箭，往协会的旁边走去，坐在了旁边的花台边。“嗯，一会见。”薛子皓握拳，“放心，我们都会通过。”诸葛明月只是淡淡的点了点头，就迈步走进了协会的大门了。参加考核的学院们已经排起了队伍，大厅中有个人正在负责登记收费。登记完收了费，才会允许进入里面进行考核。排了一会，轮到了诸葛明月。“一个金币。”负责登记的人，是个一脸呆板的中年人，他面无表情的说完这句话，就伸出了手。真他奶奶的贵！诸葛明月心中腹诽。普通家庭一年的开销也就二十个金币。这初级召唤师的考核就要交一个金币。交过了金币，中年人才懒洋洋的问道：“姓名，年龄。”“诸葛明月，十六岁。”诸葛明月回答。那中年人听到诸葛明月的名字，一直没有表情的脸终于变了，他倏的抬头看向诸葛明月，从头看到脚，眼中有些惊讶，却没有说什么，而是埋头给诸葛明月登记好，道：“从我后面进去，右拐第三号室。”这个时候，中年人的口气已经不像之前那么生硬了。诸葛明月淡淡的点了点头，道了声谢，就要越过中年人离去。身后却突然传来万俟辰的声音：“诸葛，加油啊！一定要通过。等考核完毕，我请你吃饭啊。”诸葛明月的脚步一滞，转过头来，脸上绽放出了个笑容：“一定。胖子，你也要过。”“嗯！”万俟辰用力的点头，脸上笑的跟花一样。诸葛明月笑了笑，转过头，往中年人说的第三号室走去。一个长长的走廊，两边都是标着数字的小房间。诸葛明月推开了第三号屋的门，就看到里面一个瘦削的中年男子正在埋头写着什么。听到门口的脚步声，他头也没投，随意的说道：“站中间去，召唤你的魔宠。”诸葛明月闻言，站在了中间，凝神低声念起了咒语，召唤出了肥鹦鹉。“啊啊！主人，我正在泡温泉呢，你怎么这个时候叫我啊？我差点就走光了！”肥鹦鹉一出现就呱呱的叫个不停。那瘦削的中年男子惊愕的抬头看向出现在屋子上空的肥鹦鹉。这，是来参加考核人的魔宠？“你给我闭嘴！”诸葛明月轻轻一跃，跳起来一把将肥鹦鹉拽了下来，抱在了怀里。“这，是你的魔宠？”那瘦削男子就是今日的考官，皱眉疑惑的问道。“是。”诸葛明月点头。“这……能说话的魔宠啊。”考官打量着诸葛明月怀里的肥鹦鹉，疑惑道，“这是，山鸡？”“鸡你个头啊！你眼睛长哪里了？我是鹦鹉，天下间最帅气的鹦鹉！呜呜……嗯嗯……鸡你个屁股…”肥鹦鹉勃然大怒，眼前这个人居然敢将他这样英明神武的鹦鹉和鸡相提并论。还没骂完，嘴就被诸葛明月捂住了。诸葛明月有些头疼起来，得罪考官，不知道能不能让她通过审核。“哦，是鹦鹉。”考官倒是没有生气，而是皱眉严肃的说道，“那么，这个鹦鹉属于什么类型的魔宠呢？攻击类还是防御类？”“攻击类。”诸葛明月说道。“它能攻击人？”考官看着肥嘟嘟的鹦鹉，怀疑的问道。“语言攻击也是攻击。能把人气的半死不活，气的吐血也是一项技能。”诸葛明月一本正经的严肃说道。“这个……我还真没听过有这样的攻击。”考官拿着笔在本子上轻轻敲打着，“这也能算么？真的有这样的效果？可我看它没什么杀伤力啊。长的这么胖……”“那个，考官大人，我可以让它示范下它的攻击力。”诸葛明月见考官那么犹豫的样子，想了想这样说道，如果没通过考核，或者将她的魔宠划分到观赏一类的魔宠，都不是什么好事。“行，让它示范给我看。如果确实有攻击力，我就给它划分到攻击类的魔宠。”考官点了点头，很认真的说道。诸葛明月放开了肥鹦鹉的嘴，肥鹦鹉啊的一声长叫，这才喘气道：“主人，你这是想憋死我啊？”“不准抱怨，再唧唧歪歪，我红烧了你！快点给考官大人展示一下你的语言攻击！我要是没能通过考核，我一定扒光你的毛，烤了你！”诸葛明月恐吓着。“女人真是善变，刚才还说是红烧，现在又说烤了。”肥鹦鹉小声嘀咕着，接着转头看向皱着眉的考官，不客气的开口了，“喂，你是谁啊？要我展示下我举世无双的拉风战斗力么？没问题。听到了啊。你是怎么的，怎么这么瘦？太操心？生病了？”肥鹦鹉的口气很是关切。考官微微一笑，正要回答，下面的话却让他的表情晴转多云，转小雨，再转暴雨！就差冰雹了！“我跟你说，其实瘦呢有很多种原因，有精神压迫太大的问题，还有遗传的，还有疾病的。我看你脸白成那样，应该是有病吧？有病的话呢，要及早治。要不然病入膏肓了就什么都晚了。你有薪水的吧，早点治病。如果你没老婆的话还好，有老婆的话，等你死了你老婆就会另外嫁人，你头上的帽子就会换很青翠的颜色啦。而且你死了，协会的抚恤金你也花不着，而是你老婆和其他男人花啦，最多给你出点钱买块墓地。如果你有孩子的话，那更惨啊……呜……”话说到这里，诸葛明月已经捂住了肥鹦鹉的嘴了。因为这个时候屋子里响起了清脆的咔嚓声，那是考官手里的笔被捏断了。“考官大人，那个……还需要证明么？”诸葛明月小心翼翼的问道。考官闭上眼深深的吸气，再猛的吐气，在心中默念了十遍，我是一个很有职业操守的考官，我是考官，我是考官，我非常有职业操守！我不能和一只肥鸟计较。终于迫使自己冷静下来，急速的问道，“名字？年龄？登记好了立刻给我滚出去！”“诸葛明月，十六岁。”诸葛明月讪讪的笑了笑，很配合的立刻回答。“哎呀，不要这么大火气。我听说火气大的男人会伤身，如果伤了身的话呢，病情只会加重。你就算不为自己考虑，也要为自己的老婆考虑啊……”肥鹦鹉挣脱开诸葛明月的手，叽叽呱呱的说着。“给我出去！现在立刻马上！”考官找到备用的笔，刷刷的登记好了，扔给诸葛明月一个勋章，咆哮着。诸葛明月拿好勋章，揪着肥鹦鹉立刻跑出去了，她怕再晚点，那考官反悔就惨了。－－－－－－题外话－－－－－－今天忘记更新了，哈哈。我曾经转过一个微博，内容如下：今天乘坐的出租车差点撞到一个乱穿马路的人，那人说：你敢撞吗？司机说：我是不敢！不过撞死了我赔六十万你用得到吗？还不是你老婆新的男人用！最多出两千给你买个骨灰盒！那个人顿时接不下去了~", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/fuheikuangnu-qingchengzhaohuanshi/8.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 8 I almost ran away! \"Okay, I'll buy some materials after the assessment.\" Zhuge Mingyue thought for a while and said, \"I need to buy the materials. I have simple tools at home. I'll see what else I need later.\" \"Wow, Zhuge, when did you know how to make alchemy? How come we didn't know?\" Wan Qichen asked in surprise. \"I read a few things before when I was bored. But how could you know? You haven't talked to me before.\" Zhuge Mingyue glanced at Wan Qichen with disdain. Wan Qichen lowered his head and stopped talking, feeling a little frustrated. When Zhuge Mingyue was in school, there were not many people she could talk to, let alone friends. Zhuge Mingyue doesn’t have a single friend! \"Okay, Fatty, aren't we talking now?\" Zhuge Mingyue looked at the frustrated Fatty and spoke unbearably. In fact, it's no wonder Wan Qichen was like this. Zhuge Mingyue was such a lonely person in the past. However, Zhuge Mingyue did not lie about the issue of alchemy. In the past, Zhuge Mingyue had learned some basic alchemy when he was bored. So she has the simplest tools at home, and she also knows some of the most basic recipes. But alchemy was really useless and a waste of time. Later, Zhuge Mingyue stopped learning. \"Yeah, Zhuge, we are going to take the junior summoner assessment together now.\" Upon hearing this, Wan Qichen became energetic and nodded in agreement with bright eyes. \"Okay. Let's go buy some materials after the assessment.\" After Zhuge Mingyue finished speaking, he looked at the gate of the Summoners Association. The gate was very grand, and it was very lively today. Many people came to take the junior summoner assessment today, and they were all students who successfully summoned their demon pets in the academy yesterday. \"I'll wait for you outside. You all must pass the assessment.\" Xue Zihao walked to the association with a bow and arrow on his back and sat on the flower stand next to it. \"Well, I'll see you soon.\" Xue Zihao clenched his fist, \"Don't worry, we will all pass.\" Zhuge Mingyue just nodded lightly and walked into the door of the association. The colleges participating in the assessment have already lined up, and there is a person in the hall who is responsible for registering and charging fees. Only after registering and paying the fee will you be allowed to enter for the assessment. After waiting in line for a while, it was Zhuge Mingyue's turn. \"One gold coin.\" The person in charge of registration was a middle-aged man with a dull face. After saying this expressionlessly, he stretched out his hand. It’s so expensive for his grandma! Zhuge Mingyue cursed in his heart. The annual expenses of an ordinary family are only twenty gold coins. The assessment of this junior summoner requires a gold coin. After handing over the gold coins, the middle-aged man asked lazily: \"Name, age.\" \"Zhuge Mingyue, sixteen years old.\" Zhuge Mingyue answered. When the middle-aged man heard Zhuge Mingyue's name, his expressionless face finally changed. He suddenly looked up at Zhuge Mingyue, looking from head to toe. His eyes were a little surprised, but he didn't say anything. Instead, he buried his head in registering Zhuge Mingyue and said, \"Enter from behind me and turn right into the third room.\" At this time, the middle-aged man's tone was no longer as harsh as before. Zhuge Mingyue nodded lightly, thanked him, and left over the middle-aged man. Suddenly Wan Qichen's voice came from behind: \"Zhuge, come on! You must pass. When the assessment is over, I'll treat you to a meal.\" Zhuge Mingyue's footsteps stagnated, and he turned his head with a smile on his face: \"Definitely. Fatty, you have to pass too.\" \"Yes!\" Wan Qichen nodded vigorously, with a smile on his face. Zhuge Mingyue smiled, turned around, and walked towards the third room the middle-aged man mentioned. A long corridor with small numbered rooms on either side. Zhuge Mingyue opened the door of Room No. 3 and saw a thin middle-aged man inside, immersed in writing something. Hearing the footsteps at the door, he said casually without turning his head: \"Stand in the middle and summon your magic pet.\" Upon hearing this, Zhuge Mingyue stood in the middle, recited a spell in a low voice and summoned the fat parrot. \"Ah! Master, I am taking a bath in the hot spring. Why did you call me at this time? I almost ran away!\" The fat parrot kept croaking as soon as it appeared. The thin middle-aged man looked up in shock at the fat parrot that appeared above the house. Is this the demon pet that comes to take part in the assessment? \"Shut up!\" Zhuge Mingyue jumped up slightly, pulled the fat parrot down, and held him in his arms. \"Is this your magic pet?\" The thin man was today's examiner, and he asked with a frown on his face. \"Yes.\" Zhuge Mingyue nodded. \"This... a demon pet that can talk.\" The examiner looked at the fat parrot in Zhuge Mingyue's arms and asked doubtfully, \"Is this a pheasant?\" \"How big is a chicken! Where are your eyes? I'm a parrot, the most handsome parrot in the world! Uh-huh... uh-huh... chicken, your ass...\" The fat parrot was furious. The man in front of him actually dared to compare such a wise and powerful parrot like him with a chicken. Before he finished cursing, Zhuge Mingyue covered his mouth. Zhuge Mingyue had a headache, offended the examiner, and wondered if she could pass the review. \"Oh, it's a parrot.\" The examiner was not angry, but frowned and said seriously, \"So, what type of magic pet does this parrot belong to? Attack type or defense type?\" \"Attack type.\" Zhuge Mingyue said. \"Can it attack people?\" the examiner looked at the plump parrot and asked suspiciously. \"Verbal attacks are also attacks. Being able to make people half-dead and vomit blood is also a skill.\" Zhuge Mingyue said seriously. \"This... I have never heard of such an attack.\" The examiner tapped the pen on the notebook, \"Can this count? Does it really have such an effect? ​​But I don't think it has any lethality. It is so fat...\" \"Well, Mr. Examiner, I can let it demonstrate its attack power.\" Seeing the examiner's hesitation, Zhuge Mingyue thought about it for a while.", "title_en": "Chapter 8"}